This is a '''list of presidential trips of [[Michel Temer]]''', the [[List of presidents of Brazil|37th]] [[President of Brazil]], who took office on 31 August 2016 after the [[Impeachment of Dilma Rousseff|impeachment]] of [[Dilma Rousseff]].<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www2.camara.leg.br/camaranoticias/noticias/POLITICA/515675-MICHEL-TEMER-TOMA-POSSE-COMO-PRESIDENTE-DA-REPUBLICA.html |title=Michel Temer toma posse como presidente da República |publisher=[[Chamber of Deputies (Brazil)|Chamber of Deputies]] |access-date=21 August 2017 |language=pt}}</ref> This list covers the diplomatic trips made by Michel Temer from his [[Presidency of Michel Temer|inauguration]] on 31 August 2016 until the end of his term on 1 January 2019.

