| align="left" | Temer was received by the [[President of Argentina]], [[Mauricio Macri]], for a series of meetings on trade relations between the two countries. Topics discussed on the first official trip to Brazil's [[South America]]n neighbours included the countries' border situation, the internal politics of [[Mercosur]] and the bloc's international agreements.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://g1.globo.com/politica/noticia/2016/10/temer-embarca-para-argentina-onde-fara-1-visita-oficial-como-presidente.html |title=Temer viaja para a Argentina e se reúne com Macri em Buenos Aires |publisher=[[G1 (Brazilian website)|Portal G1]] |access-date=21 August 2017 |language=pt}}</ref>
